  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the African Union High Level Meeting is to to discuss the refugee- and IDP-situation in the region and to adopt a convention on the protection of IDP:s. The issue of refugees and IDP:s is one of the largest humanitarian challenges facing Africa</narrative>
